69&#x02013;180.</p><p>Richard A. Brand MD &#x02709; Clinical Orthopaedics and Related Research, 1600 Spruce Street, Philadelphia, PA 19103, USA  e-mail: dick.brand@clinorthop.org</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>